  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Man takes up the sword in order to shield the small wound in his heart sustained in a far-off time beyond remembrance.</strong></p><p><em>—Kentaro Miura, Berserk</em></p><p>Students of the art of violence, fighters are defined by their weapon skills, and variety of martial techniques.</p><h3>Iconic Fighters</h3><ul><li><strong>Beowulf</strong>, <em>English mythology</em></li><li><strong>Gimli</strong>, <em>The Lord of the Rings</em></li><li><strong>Link</strong>, <em>The Legend of Zelda</em></li><li><strong>Sir Lancelot</strong>, <em>Arthurian legend</em></li></ul><h3>Playing Fighter</h3><p>The fighter is a mid-defense striker. In combat, get within effective distance for offense and prioritize the Attack Action.</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Attack<br /><strong>Move:</strong> Flexible<br /><strong>Starting Pack:</strong> Gladiator, Knight, Warrior, or Watchman<br /><strong>Key Stat:</strong> Might/Awareness<br /><strong>Complexity:</strong> ★☆☆☆☆<br /><strong>Training:</strong> Melee, Ranged</p><h3>Class Features</h3><table class=\"NormalTable\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Features</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1st</p></td><td><p>Fighting Style, Momentum</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2nd</p></td><td><p>Valor (-1 to Crit)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3rd</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4th</p></td><td><p>Fighting Style</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6th</p></td><td><p>Valor (-2 to Crit), Muster for Battle</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8th</p></td><td><p>Fighting Style</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10th</p></td><td><p>Valor (-3 to Crit), Harrying</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
